+++++++++++++++++++++ Requirements ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
+++++++ STEP 1 ++++++++++
Create database
Create a database named fintrack_db.

Create users table
id — primary key, auto-increment
name — user's name
email — unique
password — hashed password
created_at
updated_at

Connect Node.js to MySQL
Configure the backend so it can connect to fintrack_db.

Create database configuration
Keep database credentials in environment variables.
Do not hard-code the password in the source code.

Test the connection
Make sure the Node.js backend can successfully connect to MySQL.
